.TH SDL_GetDeviceFormFactor 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_GetDeviceFormFactor \- Get the form factor of the current device.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_system.h>
.PP
.BI "SDL_FormFactor SDL_GetDeviceFormFactor(void);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This function guesses what the device may be, but may report inaccurate or outright wrong results\[char46] For example, it may report a laptop as a desktop, or a car device as a phone\[char46]
.PP
Depending on the usage, there may be different functions better suited for each purpose\[char46] For example, activating touch controls can be done by detecting the presence of a touchscreen rather than restricting to phones and tablets\[char46]

.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the best guess for the form factor of the current device\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]6\[char46]0\[char46]

